            "review_title": "Review at Lang Ngon Corner - Vietnamese Cuisine",
            "review_text": "Toja L\n1 contribution\n0\nTerrible experience.\nJun 2026 • Family\nIt was awful; the food could have been good, but the waiter told us for everything on the menu that it would take too long or that they didn't have the ingredients. I have never experienced anything like this, and to top it off, it was extremely unfriendly. I truly advise everyone to go there. The presentation is beautiful, but it does not compensate for the shortcomings at all. So, really avoid it.\nRead more\nTranslated from German\nShow original\nWritten June 13, 2026",
