            "review_title": "Review at Lang Ngon Corner - Vietnamese Cuisine",
            "review_text": "Lee Won C\nKuala Lumpur, Malaysia23 contributions\n0\nGood local food\nJan 2020 • Family\nWas in the mall and went in for a quick lunch alone. It was empty so I was a bit sceptical. But had a very pleasant surprise. I struggled to order and the kind waitress helped me order a delicious pancake - easy to eat on my own. I went back again for dinner. As we had 5 hungry tummies we could order an item from almost every page. 3 types of spring rolls - all were good. Fried prawns were delicious and of course, had to chomp the same delicious pancake. All of us enjoyed the dinner thoroughly. Better than those highly rated places with picturesque spots.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten January 6, 2020",
